   105→        "content": "Created 16 comprehensive documentary E2E tests for web dashboard items view covering AC-11 through AC-15. Tests include:\n\nTest organization:\n- Spec Tree group (4 tests): hierarchical display, expand/collapse, nested features/requirements, click to open detail\n- Spec Item Detail group (10 tests): title/description, GWT acceptance criteria, traits section, implementation status, linked tasks with status, task linking navigation, trait chips, trait chip navigation, AC expansion with full GWT text, test coverage indicators\n- Responsive Layout group (2 tests): mobile adaptation, desktop slide-over\n\nAll tests use test.skip() pending UI component implementation. All 16 tests passing (skipped). Tests follow same pattern as tasks.spec.ts for consistency.",
